An attempted intent-to-add treatment for the untracked prompt/report files was
not possible because this environment exposes `.git` read-only (`index.lock`:
read-only file system). Consequently, as dictated by Git's normal semantics,
the untracked prompt/input and ignored log are not embedded in the patch. They
remain present as separate deliverables; no content was lost. Generated PDFs
are ignored by Git.

